{"4568830":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"ASTRAL COURT DX","steam_appid":4568830,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Court DX is an arcade precision platformer! Taking place in Heaven, you play as &quot;The Prisoner&quot; - an infamous criminal who's been to prison one too many times and is sent to death-row! Heaven's one and only court, the Astral Court, is an... odd one... and decides to grant The Prisoner with a series of deadly trials that, if completed, will allow them to get out of prison scot-free!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these trials, you platform on top of the Scales Of Justice, well several of them, collecting little stars named &quot;Shinies&quot; that spawn around the arena. You must collect a certain amount of Shinies all whilst avoiding whatever foes or obstacles have set up to stop you. Movement is made to give you as much control as possible to avoid hazards efficiently, you have a jump that can be performed even whilst falling and a double jump to get as much height as possible. There are a variety of other characters whom add extra challenge to the trials, accessible in the endless mode only however.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh did I mention an endless mode? Yep, that's right! Here's all the content Astral Court DX has...<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode, with 5 trials (8 levels in each) and 4 boss trials<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode, with many new levels and exclusive trials<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gauntlet mode, where you play through an abridged version of the campaign with Endless's arcade-y game mechanics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 playable characters (reskins not included)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 196 levels across Campaign and Endless mode!<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Court DX is an arcade precision platformer! Taking place in Heaven, you play as &quot;The Prisoner&quot; - an infamous criminal who's been to prison one too many times and is sent to death-row! Heaven's one and only court, the Astral Court, is an... odd one... and decides to grant The Prisoner with a series of deadly trials that, if completed, will allow them to get out of prison scot-free!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these trials, you platform on top of the Scales Of Justice, well several of them, collecting little stars named &quot;Shinies&quot; that spawn around the arena. You must collect a certain amount of Shinies all whilst avoiding whatever foes or obstacles have set up to stop you. Movement is made to give you as much control as possible to avoid hazards efficiently, you have a jump that can be performed even whilst falling and a double jump to get as much height as possible. There are a variety of other characters whom add extra challenge to the trials, accessible in the endless mode only however.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh did I mention an endless mode? Yep, that's right! Here's all the content Astral Court DX has...<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode, with 5 trials (8 levels in each) and 4 boss trials<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode, with many new levels and exclusive trials<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gauntlet mode, where you play through an abridged version of the campaign with Endless's arcade-y game mechanics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 playable characters (reskins not included)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 196 levels across Campaign and Endless mode!<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Astral Court DX is an arcade precision platformer! You're on death-row in a prison in Heaven, HOWEVER the Astral Court grants you with a chance at bail as long as you complete their death-defying trials! How will you weigh against justice?","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4568830\/5c40e80592b3777b66782ee4b737fb609eae0f70\/header.jpg?t=1788549809","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4568830\/251945f49b52b5b51f0b4f367f73748c88844f11\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788549809","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4568830\/251945f49b52b5b51f0b4f367f73748c88844f11\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788549809","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core I3-1115G4<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel(R) UHD Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> RealTek(R) Audio<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Most of these are just based on a laptop I own, but it's like a decently good laptop so you could probably have worser specs and still play the game.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["LUA COMPUTA"],"publishers":["LUA COMPUTA"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"